# Files this step owns: the files its own oracle patch touches, taken from
# steps/05-rank-intersect/solution/oracle.patch -- derived from the patch, not written by
# hand, so the check cannot drift away from what the step asks for.
#
# The verifier's candidate-scoped envelope check (see test.sh) reads this
# list: these are the files it inspects when the candidate changed them.
# The check also inspects the source files a candidate *adds* -- a kernel
# can arrive as a new module that an owned file merely calls -- so this
# list is a step's own scope, not the whole of what is scanned. A tree
# that changed and added nothing passes the check vacuously and says so
# in the log.
vortex-buffer/src/dispatch.rs
vortex-mask/src/intersect_by_rank.rs
